    <body>
      <div xml:id="gom-sir25">
        <head xml:id="gom-sir25-Hd1e98">Caput 25</head>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir25-Dd1e100">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir25-Hd1e102">Versus 2</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir25-d1e104">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir25-Qd1e106" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir25_2@7-9">Vir et mulier.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-sir25-Rd1e109"><name xml:id="gom-sir25-Nd1e110" ref="#RabanusMaurus">RAB.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir25-Qd1e113">Unde Paulus, <quote xml:id="gom-sir25-Qd1e115" source="http://scta.info/resource/eph5_25@1-8">Viri, diligite uxores vestras, sicut et Christus Ecclesiam</quote>. Possumus in viro spiritum, in muliere animam accipere, qui si in timore et dilectione Dei consenserint, quidquid petierint fiet eis, unde: <quote xml:id="gom-sir25-Qd1e118" source="http://scta.info/resource/mt18_19@5-8">Si duo consenserint ex vobis, fiet illis</quote>.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir25-Dd1e124">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir25-Hd1e126">Versus 3</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir25-d1e128">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir25-Qd1e130" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir25_3@1-2">Tres species.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-sir25-Rd1e133"><name xml:id="gom-sir25-Nd1e134" ref="#RabanusMaurus">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir25-Qd1e137"><seg type="qs">Possunt haec ad diabolum transferri</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">quia Conditori suo subjici noluit.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir25-Dd1e146">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir25-Hd1e148">Versus 5</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir25-d1e150">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir25-Qd1e152" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir25_5@1-2">Quae in juventute.</quote>
            Qui in juventute non discit sapientiam, in senectute fructum ejus non habet. Unde, <quote xml:id="gom-sir25-Qd1e155" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov10_4@1-10">Egestatem operata est manus remissa, <pb ed="#P" n="1211B"/> manus autem fortium divitias parat</quote>. <quote xml:id="gom-sir25-Qd1e160" source="http://scta.info/resource/ps1_3@14-17">Qui autem meditatur in lege Domini, dabit fructum in tempore suo</quote>.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir25-Dd1e165">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir25-Hd1e167">Versus 6</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir25-d1e169">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir25-Qd1e171" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir25_6@1-2">Quam speciosum.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-sir25-Rd1e174"><name xml:id="gom-sir25-Nd1e175" ref="#RabanusMaurus">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir25-Qd1e178"><seg type="qs">Canum caput decet</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">non licet eis ignorare legis scientiam et sapientiam.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir25-Dd1e188">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir25-Hd1e190">Versus 9</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir25-d1e192">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir25-Qd1e194" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir25_9@1-2">Novem insuspicabilia,</quote>
            etc. <quote xml:id="gom-sir25-Qd1e197" source="http://scta.info/resource/rom10_10@1-11">Corde creditur ad justitiam, ore autem confessio fit ad salutem</quote>. Novem ergo sunt insuspicabilia, id est ab omni suspicione falsitatis aliena, quae parit homini fides recta.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir25-Dd1e202">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir25-Hd1e204">Versus 13</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir25-d1e206">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir25-Qd1e208" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir25_13@5-5">Sapientiam.</quote>
            Quae est malum cavere. Unde, <quote xml:id="gom-sir25-Qd1e211" source="http://scta.info/resource/iob28_28@1-14">Et ecce timor Domini ipse est sapientia, et recedere a malo intelligentiam</quote>. Hinc est quod unum speciebus virtutum superadditur.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir25-Dd1e216">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir25-Hd1e218">Versus 16</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir25-d1e220">
            <pb ed="#P" n="1211C"/>
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir25-Qd1e224" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir25_16@1-2">Timor Dei.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-sir25-Rd1e227"><name xml:id="gom-sir25-Nd1e228" ref="#RabanusMaurus">RAB.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir25-Qd1e231"><seg type="qs">Quia sicut novenarius imperfectus est</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">sed ne te deserat praesentia Dei, quam amplecteris, et in aeternum frui desideras.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir25-Dd1e240">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir25-Hd1e242">Versus 17</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir25-d1e244">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir25-Qd1e246" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir25_17@1-2">Omnis plaga.</quote>
            Non est major gratia quam vera laetitia mentis, nec major plaga quam tristitia fraudulenti cordis in idololatria vel in haeresi, quia in ejus nequitia omnis malitia est.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir25-Dd1e251">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir25-Hd1e253">Versus 18</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir25-d1e255">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir25-Qd1e257" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir25_18@1-3">Et omnem plagam.</quote>
            Videt plagam cordis qui intelligit injuriam suae pravitatis, sed non videt, qui per poenitentiam non corrigit.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir25-Dd1e262">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir25-Hd1e264">Versus 22</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir25-d1e266">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir25-Qd1e268" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir25_22@1-3">Non est caput,</quote>
            etc.
            <ref xml:id="gom-sir25-Rd1e271"><name xml:id="gom-sir25-Nd1e272" ref="#RabanusMaurus">RAB.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir25-Qd1e275"><seg type="qs">Nequitia haereticorum comparata</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">ideo ejus cohabitatio omnibus noxia est.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir25-Dd1e285">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir25-Hd1e287">Versus 26</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir25-d1e289">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir25-Qd1e291" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir25_26@1-2">Brevis omnis malitia.</quote>
            Parva est omnis <pb ed="#P" n="1211D"/> malitia ad comparationem idololatriae et pravitatis haereticae, quia peccant, non per fragilitatem carnis, sed per superbiam mentis.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir25-Dd1e298">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir25-Hd1e300">Versus 30</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir25-d1e302">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir25-Qd1e304" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir25_30@1-4">Mulier si primatum habeat.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir25-Qd1e307"><seg type="qs">Historice ostendit, quam noxius sit primatus mulieris</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">contraria erit viro, id est doctori catholico perversa sentiendo et prava docendo.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </body>
